%% Topic 1 answers — examiner's-eye box; included by T1QA and the compiled QA volume.

::: eye | Repeats and near repeats
Topic 1 repeats itself more than any other topic. Several answers below cover the same ground (the status of the field in Pakistan; autonomy versus integration; Women's versus Gender Studies) — but each is built for its own question's limbs. Notice how the *same knowledge* is re-organised under *different headings*. That skill — re-cutting what you know to fit the exact question — is what this document teaches.
:::
